"This guide shows how to install ``musa-aiter`` and use its optional "
"LMCache KV-transfer adapter with vLLM on MUSA."
msgstr "本指南展示了如何安装 ``musa-aiter`` 并在 MUSA 上使用其可选的 LMCache KV 传输适配器与 vLLM。"

