msgstr "阶段 4 MUSA 句柄支持已合并。当 TorchMUSA 提供所需的内存和事件 IPC API 时，优先使用 LMCache 驱动的句柄路径："

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/musa_aiter_integration.rst:116
msgid ""
"This path lets the LMCache server access registered MUSA KV-cache tensors"
" through device handles and avoids worker-side gather/scatter copies. The"
" ``auto`` mode still selects ``engine_driven`` for MUSA, so request "
"``lmcache_driven`` explicitly to use the handle path. If the required "
"TorchMUSA IPC APIs are unavailable, use the engine-driven compatibility "
"path instead:"
msgstr "此路径允许 LMCache 服务器通过设备句柄访问注册的 MUSA KV Cache 张量，并避免工作端的收集/散布复制。``auto`` 模式仍然为 MUSA 选择 ``engine_driven``，因此请明确请求 ``lmcache_driven`` 以使用句柄路径。如果所需的 TorchMUSA IPC API 不可用，请改用引擎驱动的兼容路径："

