msgstr "步骤 7：验证缓存存储和命中"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/musa_aiter_integration.rst:171
msgid ""
"Send two repeated long-prompt requests. The first request should store KV"
" chunks; the second request should hit and retrieve them from LMCache."
msgstr "发送两个重复的长提示请求。第一个请求应存储 KV 块；第二个请求应命中并从 LMCache 中检索它们。"

