msgstr "查找类似于以下的 LMCache 日志："

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/musa_aiter_integration.rst:204
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "故障排除"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/musa_aiter_integration.rst:206
msgid ""
"If ``musa_aiter`` import fails, reinstall it in the exact environment "
"that launches vLLM."
msgstr "如果 ``musa_aiter`` 导入失败，请在启动 vLLM 的确切环境中重新安装它。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/musa_aiter_integration.rst:208
msgid ""
"If ``native_lmcache_kv_transfer_abi_version`` is missing, the installed "
"package does not provide the LMCache native adapter ABI expected by "
"LMCache."
msgstr "如果缺少 ``native_lmcache_kv_transfer_abi_version``，则安装的包不提供 LMCache 所期望的 LMCache 原生适配器 ABI。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/musa_aiter_integration.rst:210
msgid ""
"If native transfer fails but ``LMCACHE_MUSA_NATIVE_KV_TRANSFER=0`` "
"passes, the issue is isolated to ``musa-aiter`` or the native input "
"layout/contiguity requirements."
msgstr "如果本地传输失败，但 ``LMCACHE_MUSA_NATIVE_KV_TRANSFER=0`` 成功，则问题仅限于 ``musa-aiter`` 或本地输入布局/连续性要求。"

#: ../../source/developer_guide/extending_lmcache/musa_aiter_integration.rst:212
msgid ""
"If vLLM startup fails with low free memory, lower ``--gpu-memory-"
"utilization`` or choose a less busy device with ``MUSA_VISIBLE_DEVICES``."
msgstr "如果 vLLM 启动时可用内存不足，降低 ``--gpu-memory-utilization`` 或选择一个较少繁忙的设备并使用 ``MUSA_VISIBLE_DEVICES``。"

